 "contract": "The scene change from the level's end into the scene between levels, as it changes the carried session state. [488,49E): FF0690's +A2/+A4 = FF4446/FF4448. [17024,17058): the 68 pool slots (FF1B50..FF3007) and both actors (FF1AB4, FF1B02) zeroed. [F850,F872): BSR F872, BSR F940, JSR 1720C, FF17AC..FF17B3 = FFFFFFFF. [F872,F8F2): every slot and both actors: mode, +06, +12, +14 cleared, +16/+46 = 12646. [F940,F994): each control's +00 = its actor (mode cleared); FF3008 = 0, then FF300C.. = slots 0..67 and FF311C past them. [1720C,17256): FF148C..FF1493 cleared, FF1AA8 = FF148C, FF17AC/FF17B0 = FFFFFFFF, FF1AAC = FFFF, FF1AAE = FF140A, FF1AB0 = FF140A << 5 (render lists, not native). [16FB4,16FBA): FF0F16 (the acceleration gate) cleared. [16FF8,17004): BSR 131C2, FF0B92 = 001E. [131C2,13208): FF0B90 = FFFF, FF0B96 = 0, FF0B92 = 6, FF0B94 = 1, FF0EDE cleared, curves 1356A/1356A/135AA. [9880,98DE): FF0690's +08/+0C/+18 (FF13E0 selects +18) and BSR 98DE, then FF0838's (+18 inverted) and BSR 98DE. [98DE,9952): +1A6 cleared; BSR 9952; the actor's +0C = 19; JSR 1737E; +12 OR 0800; X = 0114 + +A2, Y = 00B0 + +A4; +96/+98/+3A/+18 by +18. [9952,99D4): the actor's +4A = the control, +12/+22 cleared; +5A..+6C (+30 nonzero: +5A/+5C = 0060/FFA0); +B6 = 00B0 with FF33E2 set, else 00D8; JSR 5964; +1A = AA50. [1737E,173C6): +9E/+A0/+9A/+9C/+108/+10A/+B8/+B2/+B4 cleared, +A6/+A8 = +A2/+A4 >> 3 (camera words, not native). [17284,17298): 17298 on FF0690, then FF0838. [5D6A,5D7E) with [446C,4484): +11A = FFFF, +144 cleared, +16E = 1, +F2 = FFFF on each control (not native). [5ED4,5EDC): FF0B92 = 000A. Natively make_hub_actor, hub_actor_parameters, start_fade_in, reset_object_pool and enter_hub_scene (with the cleared gate); P2's actor is compared but not carried by a session."
